  "Description": {
    "Cost": 11737654,
    "UIName": "Haze",
    "Id": "chassisdef_haze_HAZ-C",
    "Name": "Haze",
    "Details": "The C configuration of the Haze OmniMech carries eleven ER Small Lasers, which let it hit hard once it reaches close range. A Supercharger allows it to boost its speed so it can get into the optimal range for its lasers and spot for its allies along the way, while a Nova CEWS takes care of electronic warfare. The weight for all this comes from the Interface Cockpit and XXL engine that every Haze is built around.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Sensors</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.05</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
    "Icon": "Haze"
  },
